  "spr_answers": [
    "5"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Area = length \\(\\times\\) width: \\(w(w + 3) = 40\\), so \\(w^{2} + 3w - 40 = 0\\).",
    "Factor: \\((w + 8)(w - 5) = 0\\), so \\(w = -8\\) or \\(w = 5\\).",
    "A width cannot be negative, so \\(w = 5\\). Check: \\(5 \\cdot 8 = 40\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "w = symbols('w')\nsols = solve(Eq(w*(w + 3), 40), w)\npos = [s for s in sols if s > 0]\nassert sorted(sols) == [-8, 5] and pos == [5]\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == pos",
